# Mobile Sales Data Dashboard using Power BI

## Project Overview
This project focuses on analyzing mobile sales data using Microsoft Power BI. The dashboard provides interactive visualizations to understand sales performance, customer trends, and business insights.

## Tools & Technologies
- Microsoft Power BI
- Power Query
- DAX
- Data Visualization

## Key Analysis
- Total Mobile Sales
- Total Quantity Sold
- Average Sales Analysis
- Monthly Sales Trends
- Brand-wise Sales Performance
- Mobile Model Analysis
- Customer and Payment Insights

## Dashboard Features
- Interactive charts and visualizations
- Dynamic filters and slicers
- Sales performance tracking
- Business insights through data analysis

## Objective
The objective of this project is to transform raw mobile sales data into meaningful insights and support data-driven business decisions.

